diff --git a/.audit/j2k-reset.tsv b/.audit/j2k-reset.tsv
index d39f7def4cd741a5fc07f8cd851464d070f01dbb..f5e7e1768c1208256cb2c6e61ae0c988465f4891 100644
--- a/.audit/j2k-reset.tsv
+++ b/.audit/j2k-reset.tsv
@@ -82,3 +82,5 @@ ts	phase	decision	why	evidence	result
 2026-08-22T01:13:00Z	branding	replaced debug and nightly launcher overlays with Hayai adaptive, monochrome, round, and legacy-density assets	kept release-channel application IDs visually and textually Hayai-branded	app/src/debug/res; app/src/nightly/res	IMPLEMENTED_UNVERIFIED
 2026-08-22T06:11:47Z	localization	moved Hayai-owned interface text and surfaced failures into Android resources, reused valid J2K strings, and imported reviewed matching TachiyomiSY translations	tracks 1028 Hayai keys across 67 locale directories, imports reviewed translations into 20 locales, preserves English fallback, and rejects new UI literals plus unreviewed Hayai code literals	app/src/main/res/values/strings_hayai_*.xml; tools/verify-localization.ps1; tools/import-sy-translations.ps1; .github/workflows/localization.yml	VERIFIED
 2026-08-22T06:11:47Z	localization-validation	compiled the integrated app, verified resources and placeholder signatures, checked the J2K boundary, and reran the corrected E-Hentai favorites protocol test with one Gradle worker	the full 359-test run reached one obsolete exception-type assertion after 358 passes; the typed assertion was updated and its focused test class passes	gradlew --no-daemon --no-parallel --max-workers=1 :app:compileDevDebugKotlin; :app:testDevDebugUnitTest --tests dev.ahmedmohamed.hayai.adult.eh.favorites.EhFavoritesProtocolTest; tools/verify-localization.ps1 -WriteCoverage; tools/verify-upstream-boundary.ps1	VERIFIED
+2026-08-22T11:22:47+03:00	source-surface-parity	restored SY-style E-Hentai rich browse rows and tag autocomplete, exposed typed source metadata, and fixed the details parent-resolution defect that suppressed both metadata and page previews	kept source parsing, metadata persistence, preview loading, tag catalog, and presentation policy Hayai-owned behind four narrow J2K presentation adapters	SourceBrowsePresentation; SourceMetadataDocument; SourceTagCompletionFilter; MangaDetailsController.kt; BrowseSourcePresenter.kt	VERIFIED
+2026-08-22T11:22:47+03:00	source-surface-validation	compiled the app and passed focused E-Hentai browse, tag, metadata, enhanced-source, and preview tests with one Gradle worker	also verified all localization keys and the documented J2K boundary, including reviewed SY translations in 20 locales	gradlew --no-daemon --no-parallel --max-workers=1 :app:compileDevDebugKotlin :app:testDevDebugUnitTest --tests adult.eh.* --tests source.metadata.* --tests source.enhanced.*; tools/verify-localization.ps1; tools/verify-upstream-boundary.ps1	VERIFIED
